 SUM {
  coords 2533.354 339.334 11023.226
  m_sTitle "Summary"
  m_sTextData "<h2>Overview:</h2>"\
  "A US convoy returning to base has been struck by a mine, bringing the column to a halt. A route previously considered clear has now been sabotaged by an unknown enemy."\
  ""\
  "Can US forces hold their position and defend the convoy while repairs are carried out?"\
  ""\
  "<h2>Notes:</h2>"\
  "• Single US unit is intended."
  m_bEmptyFactionVisibility 1
 }
 MN {
  coords 2533.354 339.334 11023.226
  m_sTitle "Mission Notes"
  m_sTextData "<h2>End Conditions:</h2>"\
  "<b>US VICTORY</b>"\
  "• Repel the Soviet assault and cause them to withdraw (90% casualties)"\
  "OR"\
  "• Defend the convoy long enough to repair the Bradley's engine (30mins)"\
  ""\
  "<b>OPFOR VICTORY</b>"\
  "• Disrupt the convoy by destroying the Bradley, command truck, and <i>either</i> the ammo or fuel truck."\
  "OR"\
  "• Destroy 90% of US forces"\
  ""\
  "<h2>Notes:</h2>"\
  "• BLUFOR vehicle gunner is meant to be alone. It's not a bug."\
  "• JIP: TP"\
  ""\
  "Mission made by TheLocalPub"
  m_bEmptyFactionVisibility 1
  m_bShowForAnyFaction 1
  m_iOrder 10
 }
}